OCMAT 1
# THE CONTROL. Every value here is identical to M_GraphCube's; the two files differ by exactly one
# line, which is that one has a GRAPHREF and this one does not. Keep them that way -- the proof this
# project exists to give is worth nothing if the pair drift apart for any other reason.
SHADER standard
BLEND opaque
CULL back
FLAGS twosided=0 castshadow=1

PARAM baseColorFactor 0.55 0.55 0.58 1.0
PARAM metallicFactor 0.0
PARAM roughnessFactor 0.65
PARAM emissiveFactor 0.0 0.0 0.0
PARAM normalScale 1.0
PARAM occlusionStrength 1.0
